            "review_title": "Review at Sil My",
            "review_text": "旅のホルマリン漬け\nSaitama, Japan13248 contributions\n9\nHave some hand-rolled spring rolls!\nDec 2023 • Couples\nI visited here on the first day of my stay in Can Tho and had a very relaxing lunch. There was no English on the menu, so I ordered from a photo on the internet. I ordered the make-your-own spring rolls, which were delicious and a unique meal. I recommend the minced meat wrapped in leaves and baked (like small cabbage rolls), which go well with the hand-rolled spring rolls. It was also fun to eat on the terrace with a local atmosphere.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 7, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
