            "review_text": "agee66\nOttawa, Canada31 contributions\n0\nHot Pot Heaven\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nFor the adventurous eater. A lively atmosphere with huge capacity offers mainly a choice of hot pot or table bbq. We opted for the hotpot with beef and it was awesome. We were instructed with prompting from our servers on how to tackle things. Important advice: the beer in the ice bucket is warm so let it cool! The pork sausage in the hot pot was, well, pork sausage, which we were less keen on but the overall meal was great and super fun. Zero other tourists so very authentic experience. Total bill with beef hotpot and 2 beers was 240,000 Dong.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2019",
